The full bank certificates contain, as data, objects of the bank P0r12 of Zhao, Booth-Clibborn and Schwahn
(github.com/w2ll2am/diagonal-ramsey) re-encoded in our format; credit for those objects belongs to them. The source
function of Lu and Wang (github.com/sichen-wang/diagonal-ramsey-numbers) is fetched by check.sh, not redistributed.

The code (the .py, .sh, .c and .lean files) is licensed under the MIT License (LICENSE-CODE).
